  hearMoreName: SocialHearMore04
  hearMoreText: "When designed with community in mind, software becomes a powerful
    tool for connection and empowerment. Platforms that encourage knowledge sharing,
    mutual support, or local collaboration can build trust and resilience \u2014
    especially in underserved areas. Responsible design ensures these tools amplify
    diverse voices, foster inclusion, and strengthen the social fabric rather than
    fragmenting it."
